    "rule": "Not paired when the geoms overlap at rest (q = 0), except the existing pairs, which get margin = rest_margin_m: their contact starts only beyond 2 mm of penetration, so they stay inactive at rest (side-by-side fingers touch and compress slightly at rest). Finger-finger and thumb-finger pairs with pen_frac >= min_pen_frac. Functional pairs regardless of frequency: thumb pulp against every fingertip pad (pinch; condim 4, torsional friction, so a pinched pad does not spin), and every finger or thumb geom against a palm geom that it penetrates somewhere in the scan or comes within fist_reach_mm of in the fist (the palm pads are fitted to just touch the fingertips there). Always paired unless they overlap at rest: the groups under 'always'.",
